caption: Addiction Divisor
technology-rule: addiction-divisor

The base Addiction Divisor is 50.

Each point of Addiction Refinement doubles it:

Addiction Divisor = 50 * 2^R_A

| Addiction Refinement | Divisor |
| --- | --- |
| 0 | 50 |
| 1 | 100 |
| 2 | 200 |
| 3 | 400 |
| 4 | 800 |
| 5 | 1600 |
